# reject-consign-interior — only a terminal gate has a release to consign; a
# consignee on an interior (piped) gate is ill-formed at apply, exactly as a
# required grade on a non-source gate is (§6, §7.1).
actor counsel mandate review
gate  draft   risk low consign vendorb grant counsel[work_product:low]
gate  release risk low                 grant counsel[work_product:low]
cord draft   -> release
cord release -> master
